# INERT AS OF 0.1.32. ClawHub builds its artifact with `npm pack`, so contents
# are governed by package.json `files`, not by this file — verified by
# downloading the published artifact (shasum matches a local `npm pack`, and it
# still contains every dist/src/setup/** file).
#
# The entries below record the intent for the day ClawHub packs from the source
# tree: the ClawHub artifact is the OpenClaw provider plugin, and index.ts
# imports only src/provider.ts and src/image.ts, so the setup CLI is dead weight
# there. The CLI is distributed through npm, where `npx gc-provider` resolves.
#
# Excluding it from npm is NOT an option: `files` drives both channels, and
# dropping dist/src/setup would break `npx gc-provider` for everyone.
src/setup/
test/
docs/
